#: ../../../source/How-To-Guides.rst:8
msgid "How-to Guides"
msgstr "操作指南"

#: ../../../source/How-To-Guides.rst:10
msgid ""
"How-to Guides provide direct and modular answers to \"How-to\" questions "
"regarding key aspects of ROS 2. They contain succinct steps to help you "
"accomplish important tasks quickly."
msgstr ""
"操作指南針對 ROS 2 的關鍵面向提供直接且模組化的「如何做」解答。它們包含簡潔的"
"步驟，幫助您快速完成重要任務。"

#: ../../../source/How-To-Guides.rst:13
msgid ""
"How-to Guides are meant for users who already have some knowledge of ROS 2 "
"and just want to find out how to implement something specific. They will not "
"go in-depth by providing background information or teaching how a concept "
"ties into the greater ROS 2 ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"操作指南適用於已具備一定 ROS 2 知識、只想了解如何實作特定功能的使用者。它們不"
"會深入提供背景資訊，也不會講解某個概念如何融入更廣泛的 ROS 2 生態系統。"

#: ../../../source/How-To-Guides.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you are new and looking to learn the ropes, start with the :doc:"
"`Tutorials <Tutorials>` for a more well-rounded progression through ROS 2."
msgstr ""
"如果您是新手並希望學習基本知識，請從\\ :doc:`教學 <Tutorials>`\\ 開始，以獲得"
"對 ROS 2 更全面的逐步學習。"
